_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Genlogs.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2290/sm_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Genlogs.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2290/md_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Genlogs.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2290/lg_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Genlogs.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2290/xl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Genlogs.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2290/xxl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Genlogs.jpg","The future of logistics and the physical economy will be built on ground truth. Systems that rely on self-reported or delayed data will continue to break down as supply chains face rising volatility, fraud, and margin pressure. \r\n\r\nGenLogs is creating a new visibility layer by observing trucks in real time, producing intelligence that becomes more valuable and more embedded as adoption grows. With a network that compounds and a team purpose-built to verify reality at scale, GenLogs is positioned to become foundational infrastructure for how goods move across the country.","GenLogs | IVP","The Truck Intelligence Platform Delivering Ground Truth Visibility",{"id":30,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":31,"assetUrlXs":32,"assetUrlSm":33,"assetUrlMd":34,"assetUrlLg":35,"assetUrlXl":36,"assetUrlXxl":37},"1948","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1948/GenLogs_Founder_Photo__1_.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1948/xs_GenLogs_Founder_Photo__1_.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1948/sm_GenLogs_Founder_Photo__1_.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1948/md_GenLogs_Founder_Photo__1_.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1948/lg_GenLogs_Founder_Photo__1_.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1948/xl_GenLogs_Founder_Photo__1_.png","https://assets.ivp.com/sys